==========================
Tools/Pre-requsites
==========================
- Download and install msys64 from https://www.msys2.org/
- Open ucrt64.exe from msys installed path and install the below:
    pacman -S libtool
    pacman -S autotools
    pacman -S mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-gcc
    pacman -S mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-libusb
    pacman -U https://repo.msys2.org/mingw/ucrt64/mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-boost-1.81.0-2-any.pkg.tar.zst
    pacman -S make
    pacman -S  mingw-w64-ucrt-x86_64-thrift
	
- If you face any issues while installing above packages, please check your firewall settings.	
	
==========================
Obtaining OpenOCD From GIT
==========================
Code linaro source link: https://git.codelinaro.org/clo/la/openocd-org/openocd

Clone the git repo:
git clone --recursive -j8 https://git.codelinaro.org/clo/la/openocd-org/openocd.git


Download/clone below submodules with same version from the release notes
-	Openocd/jimtcl
-	Openocd/src/jtag/drivers/libjaylink

After Cloning/downloading the above submodules, copy the content to respective submodule's folders.

Please make sure that versions of openocd repo & submodules are as per release notes

============================
Commands to build
============================
Open ucrt64.exe from the msys folder and cd to the root of openocd.

Before building the opeocd, make sure that boost library,include paths are correct inside <root>\src\jtag\drivers\eud\Makefile.am (LIBADD,CPPFLAGS)

Run the below commands to build openocd.exe

- make clean 
- make clean-am
- make distclean
- ./bootstrap
- ./configure  LIBS="$(g++ -print-file-name=libstdc++.a)" --disable-werror  --disable-dependency-tracking --enable-eud --disable-dummy --disable-rshim --disable-ftdi --disable-stlink --disable-ti-icdi --disable-ulink --disable-usb-blaster-2 --disable-ft232r --disable-vsllink --disable-xds110 --disable-cmsis-dap-v2 --disable-osbdm --disable-opendous --disable-aice --disable-usbprog --disable-rlink --disable-armjtagew --disable-cmsis-dap --disable-nulink --disable-kitprog --disable-usb-blaster --disable-presto --disable-openjtag --disable-jlink --disable-parport --disable-parport-giveio --disable-jtag_vpi --disable-jtag_dpi --disable-amtjtagaccel --disable-zy1000-master --disable-zy1000 --disable-ioutil --disable-bcm2835gpio --disable-imx_gpio --disable-ep93xx --disable-at91rm9200 --disable-gw16012 --disable-oocd_trace --disable-buspirate --disable-sysfsgpio --disable-xlnx-pcie-xvc --disable-minidriver-dummy --disable-remote-bitbang --disable-parport-ppdev --disable-internal-libjaylink --disable-esp-usb-jtag
- make -j 32  EUDINCDIR=./eud/inc  EUDLIBDIR=./eud/bin